<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta’s intensified airstrikes have hit Sittwe, killing two people and prompting civilian flight to Yangon, while a bus crash in Mandalay region killed six and injured twelve. Aung San Suu Kyi spoke with her son for the first time in over five years, and military commander Min Aung Hlaing met Japan envoy Sasakawa, indicating diplomatic engagement amid the fighting. The Arakan Army is finalising a relocation plan for villages on the Bangladesh-Myanmar border, and Chin forces are resisting a junta offensive in southern Chin. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE8tWVd6bUotYTVGSzlmTURESXQ2SHhqLXdXMVRob01Da1hQTDVKbmtNUFNDSm1pU0l5cFlDSjFERk9ZMzdtbkpMc0pVdFVoMWVGM0JrcllmSW8xaDY2S0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOVGdSN0toZHZUdF83RzFxOXg0OU1zVkU1OFJpOTlFVGF5NmFTbWxsUENuNkR4X0tuLXVNSDEyREo0NVMtMGxpampQdDdQQzA4RUJpV3ppemYtR081ZXBOcXBoTVZ2VVNHMHFuOGk1cWxETk9TdG4zTHVuZlFjaVhZQlpnOVV1TzFzcXc5cWIwekkzcS16ek16Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNSWl4SlBja1R4RkhhaTMxemplMld0aldQMmlzbzdsOVlPMnJFWVNwRVVMa1dnanFtOVctTlEyWjl0SnI4Q3I4TzQ4QU5LRjRtX3BKSXc2RE5tQTNRSWhKYXlvX01QdE1OZWlQc1d4ZkZwWWxVQTVGLUR1NWFVWjZYcFNvNDJXS1hOYXUtVWRQSkdwMVZ5MGtUcHpjUTI3TjZ6M0VZaUdhLVdSTzA5UXkyYXlWUTFyRHlXb0tF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPMEoyNTRacGFNellGb0JqTUVRYXNWbWxoZkczZmFuLU1FczhkZEFsYUV6Nk1Iay1Jc2xDc0F0aDFGUEhEZHBHdlFka0p3czBFb0dRSEF4UjRkUnliVERuNkNiVkRmZHhrMnA5US01a3BaZ0o1TG1PMXJWZjNRb1A0bklWNVNvTURROWtYQjl1XzYzMjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/southeast-asia/article/33